:: Examine Altar
You study the altar more closely. Carved into the stone are ancient runes -- you recognize a few from your studies.

The runes tell a story: "The Amulet of Thornwood was forged to seal the breach. When the Keep fell, the seal broke. The amulet was lost. He who holds the amulet may command the seal -- or break it forever."

This is more than a simple artifact. It's a key to something much larger.

